SUMMARY:Our Communities Textiles Treasures : Textiles Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Every textile has a story to tell\, and every story helps prese
 rve the history of the Redlands. Community Textile Treasures celebrates a 
 collection of special textile items connected to local families\, memories
 \, and milestones. From handmade garments and embroidered linens to treasu
 red keepsakes and heirloom pieces\, each item on display carries a unique 
 story waiting to be shared. Among the exhibition are pieces lovingly creat
 ed for family members\, treasured sewing projects\, inherited textiles\, a
 nd items that have become cherished reminders of people\, places\, and mom
 ents in time. Together\, they create a rich tapestry of community history\
 , craftsmanship\, and personal connections. As you explore the exhibition\
 , discover the fascinating stories woven into every stitch and learn how t
 hese treasured objects help tell the story of the Redlands and the people 
 who have called it home.
LOCATION:Redlands Coast Museum
URL:https://redlandscoastmuseum.org.au/exhibitions/our-communities-textiles
 -treasures-textiles-exhibition/
